body:

<h4>1996, 1997, 2002, 2013</h4>

<h3>Documents and files covered</h3>

This copyright notice covers all of Euclid&rsquo;s <i>Elements</i>,
documents, and files served by the web servers in the clarku.edu
domain within the folder <code>~djoyce/java/elements</code> or its
subfolders.

<h3>Basic Permissions</h3>

Currently, all rights are reserved.

<p>Web links, however, may be freely made to Euclid&rsquo;s <i>Elements</i>
with a reference to the introduction at <a href="/">/</a>.
